{'symbol': 'ROP', 'date': '2021-09-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'ROPER TECHNOLOGIES TO PRESENT AT RBC CAPITAL MARKETS VIRTUAL INVESTOR CONFERENCE', 'text': "SARASOTA, FLA., SEPT. 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ROPER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: ROP) ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS PRESENTING AT AN INVESTOR CONFERENCE SPONSORED BY RBC CAPITAL MARKETS ON FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2021 AT 10:00 AM (EASTERN TIME). A LINK TO THE VIRTUAL PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE IN THE “INVESTORS” SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT WWW.ROPERTECH.COM. THE PRESENTATION CAN ALSO BE ACCESSED DIRECTLY BY USING THE FOLLOWING URL HTTPS://RBC.EVENT."}